UCAUCUAUUAAACCUGCAGAA&AGAACUCAACAAAAAUCCAGUGGAAGGCUUUUCUGCAGGUUUAAUAGAUGACAAUGAUCUCUACCGAUGGGAAGUCCUUAUUAUUGGCCCUCCAGAUACACUUUAUGAAGGUGGUGUUUUUAAGGCUCAUCUUACUUUCCCAAAAGAUUAUCCCCUCCGACCUCCUAAAAUGAAAUUCAUUACAGAAAUCUGGCACCCAAAUGUUGAUAAAAAUGGUGAUGUGUGCAUUUCUA\
